Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:36.22,Hook,,0,0,0,,MUY CONFIADO EN GTA 6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me quedo con el efectivo\Nencima.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.66,0:00:02.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No lo voy a perder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:04.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Estoy seguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:06.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Perdí 2,000 dólares, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:08.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ay, no, hombre...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:11.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡No, hombre!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:12.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Es en serio?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.82,0:00:15.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Y también se fueron mis\Narmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:17.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Dios mío.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:18.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Estoy furioso.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:19.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Y mi auto?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.74,0:00:21.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Dónde está mi auto?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:23.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No puede ser, mi auto está\Nahí.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.74,0:00:25.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Confiscado.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:27.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ay, no, hombre.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:29.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué estamos haciendo,\Nbro?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.52,0:00:30.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Da igual.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:32.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Voy a ser súper rico.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:34.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué importan 2,000\Ndólares?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:36.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Pronto me limpio el\Ntrasero con ese dinero.
